00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:35.800
 As you change your life, your organism cooperates

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:40.400
 and becomes more efficient in that way of life.

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:45.320
 But the Darwinists didn't like that idea

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:50.520
 of the intelligence of the common person

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:52.920
 or the common organism.

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:58.240
 And they invented the assumption of randomness.

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:02.760
 It's a metaphysical idea created out of thin air

00:24:02.760 --> 00:24:08.400
 that, for some reason, changes can only be random.

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:11.280
 And they did it to atoms that said

00:24:11.280 --> 00:24:15.960
 that the change of one type of atom to another

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:20.800
 can only be random and unpredictable.

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:25.760
 Nuclear transmutations are a chance event.

00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:30.320
 And they applied that to biological changes.

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:36.320
 At first, the traits were immortal and unchanging then.

00:24:36.320 --> 00:24:42.880
 When they saw mutations or actual changes happening,

00:24:42.880 --> 00:24:49.680
 they said those are only completely random and useless.

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:58.360
 And the mechanism of intelligent adaptation of learning

00:24:58.360 --> 00:25:02.160
 to play the flute or the trumpet or something,

00:25:02.160 --> 00:25:08.880
 you have to develop muscular skills, mental skills,

00:25:08.880 --> 00:25:12.320
 and change your organism to do that.

00:25:12.320 --> 00:25:15.600
 But that kind of adaptation, they

00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:23.160
 created a way to see it as simply a summing up

00:25:23.160 --> 00:25:30.480
 of many meaningless random diffusions of molecules

00:25:30.480 --> 00:25:32.400
 through the system.

00:25:32.400 --> 00:25:35.040
 You change your behavior.

00:25:35.040 --> 00:25:41.560
 And the modifications that happen as a result

00:25:41.560 --> 00:25:46.800
 of that changed behavior involve random diffusion

00:25:46.800 --> 00:25:52.880
 of particles that end up changing the genes.

00:25:52.880 --> 00:25:58.320
 But the whole idea of avoiding purposefulness

00:25:58.320 --> 00:26:05.400
 at every point of life processes that has been going on now

00:26:05.400 --> 00:26:07.720
 for about 200 years.

